---
// Four-panel comic strip for colleague-ai "01 Problem": a new teacher on the AI assessment platform
// (a new AI tool → where do the questions go → the rubric opens elsewhere → booked into training).
// Same visual language as ProblemScenes / SeattleProblemScenes: black hand-drawn strokes, one accent
// colour (var(--cs-accent)), slight wobble, no faces, no text in the art, 1–4 comic dots per panel.
// Illustrations are decorative (aria-hidden); the captions carry the meaning.
---
<figure class="ps">
  <svg width="0" height="0" class="ps-defs" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <defs>
      <filter id="cps-wobble" x="-5%" y="-5%" width="110%" height="110%">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.035" numOctaves="2" seed="7" />
        <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" scale="2.2" />
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>
  <ol class="ps-grid">
    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M14 112 L170 110"/>
  <path d="M70 52 L134 51 L135 96 L71 97 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M62 104 L144 103 L140 110 L66 111 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M80 62 L112 62 M80 70 L124 70 M80 78 L104 78" stroke-width="1.3"/>
  <circle cx="34" cy="70" r="11" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M14 112 Q16 86 34 84 Q52 86 56 104" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M146 76 L174 74 L175 106 L147 108 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M143 82 L171 80 L172 104 L144 106 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M150 88 L166 87 M150 94 L164 93 M150 100 L160 99" stroke-width="1.2"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" style="fill:var(--cs-accent)">
  <path d="M120 24 L123 32 L131 35 L123 38 L120 46 L117 38 L109 35 L117 32 Z"/>
  <path d="M140 18 L141.5 22 L145.5 23.5 L141.5 25 L140 29 L138.5 25 L134.5 23.5 L138.5 22 Z"/>
  <path d="M110 84 L126 84 L126 90 L110 90 Z" style="fill-opacity:.35"/>
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">A new AI tool for tests</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">A teacher opens Colleague.AI to build a test, write a rubric and grade with AI. She has never used it before.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M22 16 L130 15 L131 124 L23 125 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M34 28 L70 28" stroke-width="1.6"/>
  <path d="M34 40 L118 40 L118 48 L34 48 Z" stroke-width="1.3"/>
  <path d="M34 58 L56 58" stroke-width="1.3"/>
  <path d="M34 64 L118 64 L118 102 L34 102 Z" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <path d="M34 110 L64 110 L64 118 L34 118 Z" stroke-width="1.3"/>
  <path d="M96 84 L96 104 L101 99 L105 108 L109 106 L105 97 L112 97 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="1.6"/>
  <path d="M146 56 Q156 44 164 54 Q170 64 158 70 L156 80"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" style="fill:var(--cs-accent)">
  <path d="M35 65 L117 65 L117 101 L35 101 Z" style="fill-opacity:.16"/>
  <circle cx="156" cy="92" r="3.6"/>
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="164" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">Where do the questions go?</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">The form asks for a description. She can’t tell if the AI writes the questions or she does.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M16 30 L82 29 L83 112 L17 113 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M16 30 L40 30 L40 22 L16 22 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M26 44 L64 44 M26 54 L72 54 M26 64 L58 64" stroke-width="1.3"/>
  <path d="M26 80 L72 80 L72 90 L26 90 Z" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/>
  <path d="M100 24 L170 23 L171 106 L101 107 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M100 24 L126 24 L126 16 L100 16 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M110 40 L162 40 M110 56 L162 56 M110 72 L162 72 M110 88 L162 88 M127 34 L127 96 M144 34 L144 96" stroke-width="1.2"/>
  <path d="M104 118 Q86 128 70 100" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" style="fill:var(--cs-accent)">
  <path d="M101 25 L170 25 L170 33 L101 33 Z" style="fill-opacity:.35"/>
  <path d="M128 57 L143 57 L143 71 L128 71 Z" style="fill-opacity:.25"/>
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="156" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="164" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">The rubric opens somewhere else</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">She builds a rubric with AI. It opens in a new tab and never joins her test.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M74 22 L166 21 L167 112 L75 113 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M74 38 L166 37"/>
  <path d="M94 16 L94 28 M146 15 L146 27" stroke-width="1.8"/>
  <path d="M75 62 L166 61 M75 87 L166 86 M98 38 L98 112 M121 38 L121 112 M144 37 L144 112" stroke-width="1.2"/>
  <circle cx="34" cy="74" r="11" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M14 126 Q16 98 34 96 Q52 98 54 126" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#cps-wobble)" style="fill:var(--cs-accent)">
  <path d="M122 63 L143 63 L143 85 L122 85 Z" style="fill-opacity:.85"/>
  <path d="M75 23 L165 23 L165 36 L75 36 Z" style="fill-opacity:.16"/>
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="148" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="156" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="164" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">Booked into training</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">She can’t finish on her own. New teachers like her get a training session first.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</figure>

<style>
  .ps { margin: 0; }
  .ps-defs { position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .ps-grid { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .ps-card { display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr; gap: 6px; }
  .ps-art { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px; background: transparent; overflow: visible; }
  .ps-title { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: #111111; }
  .ps-text { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3A3A3A; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .ps-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 28px 20px; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .ps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .ps-art { max-width: 360px; } }
</style>
